---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="请求的页面不存在。">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container notice-panel" style="max-width: 720px" data-reveal>
      <div class="eyebrow">404 / Lost in the snow</div>
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 6rem); letter-spacing: -0.06em">页面未找到</h1>
      <p>这条路径还没有被收录。回到首页，从开发日志、项目或工具重新进入。</p>
      <div class="button-row" style="margin-top: 22px"><a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
